---
/** Usage in MDX: <PullQuote>Sentence worth repeating.</PullQuote> (repeats body text, so hidden from screen readers) */
---

<aside class="pull-quote" aria-hidden="true"><slot /></aside>

<style>
  .pull-quote {
    margin-block: 2.5em;
    padding-block: 1.1rem;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--ink);
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    line-height: 1.3;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
</style>
